// The Lean reference harnesses, type-checked.
//
// ⚠ **Nothing else reads these files.** The root `tsconfig.json` includes only
// `src/**/*` and `tsconfig.test.json` only `src` + `tests`, so `lean/experiments`
// is in neither; Biome's config ignores the directory outright ("These paths
// were provided but ignored"); and they run under `tsx`, which strips types
// without checking them. Measured 2026-08-03 (#418).
//
// These are not ordinary scripts — they are the ORACLE. Each `*-refs.mts` drives
// the TS arm and prints the `#guard` literals that get pasted into the Lean
// modules and then defended by the deploy gate forever. A misspelled field reads
// `undefined`, formats as `"undefined"` or `NaN`, and is pinned as though V8 had
// said it. That failure is silent in the direction that matters: it does not
// crash, it produces a confident wrong reference.
//
// Not hypothetical in kind. Tranche 9 (`56542fa`) shipped a harness that
// re-parsed a FORMATTED trace string instead of the raw float, and six guards
// were pinned to 6-decimal values. That one surfaced because the Lean guards then
// failed to elaborate — but a type error need not fail anything at all. It just
// moves the pinned value, quietly, and the gate defends the new one.
//
// Third instance of "the checking code is the least-checked code in the repo",
// after `frontend/tsconfig.e2e.json` (the layout harness) and the Playwright
// config it covers. See that file's header for the canary measurement.
//
// `rootDir` is the repo root because the harnesses import the TS arm across the
// `lean/` boundary (`../../src/geo/*.js`). `noEmit` — nothing here is built.
//
// `../src/types/**/*.d.ts` is included explicitly: ambient `declare module`
// blocks are not reachable by import, so without it the src files these
// harnesses pull in fail on `tz-lookup` — an error about MY config, not about
// their code.
{
  "extends": "../tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": true,
    "rootDir": "..",
    "types": ["node"]
  },
  "include": ["experiments/**/*.mts", "../src/types/**/*.d.ts"],
  "exclude": ["node_modules"]
}
